18) Balance & QA Checklist

Drop rates: elite 10–18%; boss shards 25%.

Craft times: T1 15–30m; T2 45–90m; T3 2–3h; Rush doubles fail chance.

Contraband: checks primarily in Noble and Queen’s Circle (tiers 10/25/40%).

Filter wear: respirator −10 per storm, −5 per sandworm fight.

Stress test cap: storm + night + low Stability must not exceed 85%.

Safe cells: at least two safe cells adjacent to every oasis even during storms.

Three profile walks on example seed:
Civic path → Stability ≥ +1 mid-arc.
Profit path → MPI ≤ 35; cheaper Black Market, more night pressure.
Shadow path → variable Stability; high counter-contract risk; ensure anti-hex matters.

